{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25253","headline":"送令狐秀才赴举 · 李逢吉","name":"送令狐秀才赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子有雄文藻思繁，龆年射策向金门。\n前随鸾鹤登霄汉，却望风沙走塞垣。\n独忆忘机陪出处，自怜何力继飞翻。\n那堪两地生离绪，蓬户长扃行旅喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李逢吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}